  "intro": "Season five kicks off with the reigning champ immediately walking into a buzzsaw: Adam Stockwell, Mr. Consistent himself, opens on the road at Logan Rezac, who spent all offseason wearing last year's dress and would very much like to talk about literally anything else. Elsewhere, the league's designated postseason ghost Noah Thesing gets a Week 1 reminder that the regular season is still where he's historically allergic to looking good, projected to lose at John Lundquist. Nobody's record means anything yet, but somebody in this slate is about to spend eight months hearing about it anyway."
